    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300e The linked clues turn to one truth. \u300f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/47aeadaad964b35bd834ccf044a07e4a.poster.avif?t=1747193344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/47aeadaad964b35bd834ccf044a07e4a.webm?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/47aeadaad964b35bd834ccf044a07e4a.mp4?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connected Clue is a mystery adventure game in which a detective directly runs through the scene and solves cases.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a robbery at a bank.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They stole the treasure, which had been kept tightly there, along with the large sum of money in the bank vault, and fled.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a new detective with persistence and passion, Diana, and reveal what the criminals are for and the truth of the case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/e0eb1c7ae66710711a6af5c02b335f35.poster.avif?t=1747193344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/e0eb1c7ae66710711a6af5c02b335f35.webm?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/e0eb1c7ae66710711a6af5c02b335f35.mp4?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Evidence gathering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate the scene of the incident or use several tools to collect evidence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe clues in detail using magnifying glass, obtain fingerprints using charcoal powder, etc  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather detailed evidence and secure relevant testimony through probing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/82f53aa0ce401ebe6b0a9648e09aac31.poster.avif?t=1747193344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/82f53aa0ce401ebe6b0a9648e09aac31.webm?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/82f53aa0ce401ebe6b0a9648e09aac31.mp4?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Investigating the investigation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can talk to people and get hints about events in them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Understand what kind of person you are through the characteristics of the other person and get a clue to the case.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/3c5ce9c876524b25f505d637e53ae6ec.poster.avif?t=1747193344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/3c5ce9c876524b25f505d637e53ae6ec.webm?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/3c5ce9c876524b25f505d637e53ae6ec.mp4?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Sneak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move forward without getting caught out of those who are wary of their surroundings.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The other way is to dress up for hidden costumes throughout the village. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b6f3713d68fb32f2845280c0d7e1a72e.poster.avif?t=1747193344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b6f3713d68fb32f2845280c0d7e1a72e.webm?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b6f3713d68fb32f2845280c0d7e1a72e.mp4?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Reasoning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The evidence obtained can be organized in the 'Detective Wall' inside the detective's office.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guess the truth of the case, such as who the victim is, what kind of relationship he has with the criminal, and what the weapon is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If all the suspects have gathered in one place and seen through the lies in their testimony, point to the culprit through a number of questions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/941ce1b09ebae7f1f10a7a42c15d1b49.poster.avif?t=1747193344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/941ce1b09ebae7f1f10a7a42c15d1b49.webm?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/941ce1b09ebae7f1f10a7a42c15d1b49.mp4?t=1747193344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Diana be able to solve all the cases and catch the robbers who stole the treasure? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now unleash your reasoning skills to the fullest and challenge the unsolved case!</p>",
